  {
   "text": "Bitcoin fell about 14% in a week to around $63,500 on Nov 18, 2026, more than $10,000 below its Nov 11 level near $74,000, and CoinPaprika data at 22:16 UTC that day put it at $62,326, down 4.2% in 24 hours and 15.2% over seven days.",
