  {
   "text": "US spot Bitcoin ETFs posted $239.9 million of net outflows on Tuesday Nov 17, 2026, with BlackRock's IBIT accounting for $209.5 million or about 87%, after the spot funds had already shed about $1.91 billion across seven straight sessions through Nov 13.",
   "source": "BitcoinWorld",
   "url": "https://bitcoinworld.co.in/bitcoin-weekly-selloff-etf-outflows/"
  },
  {
   "text": "CME FedWatch showed a 96% chance of the Federal Reserve raising its benchmark rate by 25 basis points to 4.25% in December, as reported on Nov 18, 2026, after three consecutive monthly core CPI readings of 0.3%.",
