  {
   "text": "BlackRock's IBIT recorded more than $2 billion of net outflows over nine consecutive trading sessions as of Nov 12, 2026, including $269.7 million on the most recent Wednesday, about 90% of that day's roughly $300 million across all US spot Bitcoin ETFs.",
